    <h1>Linq2GraphQL.Client</h1>
    <p>A straightforward Linq to GraphQL Client</p>

    <h4><a href="https://linq2graphql.com"> Documentation </a> <span> · </span> <a
            href="https://github.com/Linq2GraphQL/Linq2GraphQL.Client/issues"> Report Bug </a> <span> · </span> <a
